  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></math> are the impact parameters corresponding to scattering angles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> respectively, when an <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> particle is approaching a gold nucleus. For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> will be _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The relation&nbsp;between impact parameter and scattering angle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>z</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>E</mi></mfrac><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msqrt><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
